  "solution": "Kí hiệu <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math> lần lượt là tập hợp các số là bội của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>4</mn></semantics></math>, bội của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>5</mn></semantics></math> trong các số tự nhiên từ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>1</mn></semantics></math> đến <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>30</mn></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo minsize=\"1.2\" maxsize=\"1.2\" stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>28</mn><mo minsize=\"1.2\" maxsize=\"1.2\" stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo><mo>;</mo><mspace width=\"1.0em\"/><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo minsize=\"1.2\" maxsize=\"1.2\" stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>30</mn><mo minsize=\"1.2\" maxsize=\"1.2\" stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tTập hợp các số là bội của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>4</mn></semantics></math> hoặc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>5</mn></semantics></math> (trong các số từ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>1</mn></semantics></math> đến <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>30</mn></semantics></math>) là\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo minsize=\"1.2\" maxsize=\"1.2\" stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>30</mn><mo minsize=\"1.2\" maxsize=\"1.2\" stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tTa thấy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>12</mn></semantics></math> phần tử.<br>Vậy, trong các số tự nhiên từ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>1</mn></semantics></math> đến <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>30</mn></semantics></math>, có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>12</mn></semantics></math> số là bội của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>4</mn></semantics></math> hoặc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>5</mn></semantics></math>.<br><em>Nhận xét</em>: Ta có thể giải theo cách khác như sau:<br>Ta có: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo minsize=\"1.2\" maxsize=\"1.2\" stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mn>20</mn><mo minsize=\"1.2\" maxsize=\"1.2\" stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Từ đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
